<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <p>This policy explains cookies and similar technologies on trucksofnevada.com, run by Trucks of Nevada, 1260 Rockpebble Ave, North Las Vegas, NV 89030. Questions: <a href="mailto:info@trucksofnevada.com">info@trucksofnevada.com</a> or <%= phone_link "(702) 333-2463" %>. The <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_policy_path %> describes the personal information itself. The <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path %> cover use of the site.</p>

    <h2>What we mean</h2>
    <p>A cookie is a small text file a site stores on your browser. Local storage is a similar slot in the browser that scripts can read later. Pixels and tags are scripts that contact another company. This site uses one essential cookie, one local-storage record for your choice, and — only after you accept — Google’s analytics and advertising tags.</p>
    <p>Essential storage does not wait for a banner. Analytics and advertising storage does. The Google tag is not loaded, and the phone number on the page is not swapped, until you accept the matching category. Reject is the same size as Accept. You can reopen the choice at any time with <button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="cookie-consent#openSettings">Cookie settings</button>.</p>

    <h2>Essential</h2>
    <p>These are on because the site cannot securely take a form submission, or remember that you already decided, without them. They are not used for advertising.</p>
