    <h2>Analytics, off until you accept</h2>
    <p>If you accept analytics, the site loads Google Analytics 4, measurement ID <code>G-C34J9TNX1Y</code>. Google then receives pages viewed, roughly how you got there, general device and browser data, and an approximate location derived from your IP address. GA4 does not store the full IP address in reports. We use this to see which pages are used. We do not build a customer profile from it, and we do not sell it.</p>
